# Ignore only what is rebuildable or re-exportable. Everything original is
# tracked: this instance repo is private, and pushing it is the backup.
#
# plans/ is the exception and the only original work not backed up by a push.
# A plan is scaffolding for one piece of work: what it decided lands in the
# code, the rules or learn/lessons.md, and what is left stays in the plan
# until it does. A plan whose work has landed moves to plans/archive/.
# Anything still only in a plan has not been recorded yet.
.DS_Store
plans/
.claude/settings.local.json
profile/network/export/
apply/*/*.pdf
profile/*.pdf
.venv/
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
.sweep-seen.json
